  "body": "I have lots of rooms for three people, where only I am an admin, and where each of the members sees the other two as the name of the room. It seems it is no longer possible to create those - when clicking the OK button the room name field gets a red rim, and an error message appears. Until [variables in room names are possible](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/issues/1150), please allow nameless rooms!\r\n\r\nBTW: naming the room on creation and then deleting the name again later works - but it is an ugly work-around for something that ought to work out-of-the-box.  *Not* having an exception for the empty string for room names ought to simplify both spec and implementations.",
